  "caveats": [
    "Dagger Cloud plans (Individual free / Team $50 per month flat for up to 10 users / Enterprise custom) are 'EARLY ACCESS' observability + module-sharing plans capped by monthly telemetry events (1M / 10M). Hosted compute now exists separately as Cloud Engines (used by Cloud Checks, early access), metered in core minutes, but no price is published. The self-hosted engine is free.",
    "Inventory exclusion: CI engine/cloud observability, not hosted CPU. Card contains no numeric compute modes and no selectable price plan.",
    "Null values mean unknown, not free/unlimited. No model-token cost, tax or unverified ancillary charge included.",
    "Native browser/device/task/credit prices with unknown CPU/RAM are deliberately non-priceable. Check regime before interpreting any partial resource estimate."
